# Pin the generated types file to LF.
#
# .github/workflows/db-types.yml regenerates supabase/database.types.ts on Linux
# and gates on `git diff --exit-code`. If a contributor on Windows ever commits
# it with CRLF (which happens with core.autocrlf=false), CI would regenerate LF,
# and every line would differ while looking byte-identical in a diff view --
# blocking the PR with no visible cause. Line endings are part of this file's
# contract, so state them rather than depending on each developer's git config.
#
# Deliberately scoped to the generated file only: a repo-wide `* text=auto`
# would renormalise unrelated files and is not this change's business.
supabase/database.types.ts text eol=lf
